# Tome of the Dead D3-7 T6 dropped-ammo floor glyphs (game.md §6.3, level_defs.asm T_DAGGERS/T_ARROWS).
# DRAFT 2026-10-13 for user review on the Design canvas (fragment: assets/gfx/tiles/ammo.svg.html,
# tools/ammo_preview.py). Format = tools/gfx_convert.py --mode tile: 8x8, 1 ink on black paper.
# Drawn in the air cell standing on the floor row (one stack per cell); the art sits on rows 1-7
# with row 7 = the resting edge. Own attr (not FLOOR_IDS): black paper, so no clash with any
# depth's floor paper. Non-solid, flags 0.
#   daggers = common id 17 T_DAGGERS: pile of 3 -- two crossed leaning daggers over one lying
#             flat (blade right, guard col 5). Ink $47 bright white = the DAGGERS bar icon.
#   arrows  = common id 18 T_ARROWS: two arrows lying parallel, heads right, fletching left,
#             the lower one offset 1 px back (a loose bundle). Ink $07 white (game.md §6.3);
#             review option: $06 yellow (wood, = the BOW bar icon) -- a designer/doc change.
